   "text": "The relay may publish a row twice.\nEach row has a stable unique id and\nconsumers must be idempotent.",
   "originalText": "The relay may publish a row twice.\nEach row has a stable unique id and\nconsumers must be idempotent.",
   "fontSize": 18,
