   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One line: don't tell Kafka. Tell your OWN database, in the same transaction as the change,\nand let a relay tell Kafka for you until it is certain it has.",
   "originalText": "One line: don't tell Kafka. Tell your OWN database, in the same transaction as the change,\nand let a relay tell Kafka for you until it is certain it has.",
