   "text": "NONE of these can create inconsistency: the durable intent is already committed in the database,\nso it can only arrive LATE or arrive TWICE. It cannot vanish, and it cannot be invented.",
   "originalText": "NONE of these can create inconsistency: the durable intent is already committed in the database,\nso it can only arrive LATE or arrive TWICE. It cannot vanish, and it cannot be invented.",
