   "text": "Keep the partition count stable (changing it remaps keys).\nIdempotent producer with max.in.flight <= 5: retries within\na session do not reorder.",
   "originalText": "Keep the partition count stable (changing it remaps keys).\nIdempotent producer with max.in.flight <= 5: retries within\na session do not reorder.",
