   "text": "Throughput: a batching polling relay handles THOUSANDS of events/s on one Postgres primary.\nBeyond that: move to CDC, partition the relay, or ask whether the stream needs an outbox at all.",
   "originalText": "Throughput: a batching polling relay handles THOUSANDS of events/s on one Postgres primary.\nBeyond that: move to CDC, partition the relay, or ask whether the stream needs an outbox at all.",
