   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why it fits: config changes are low-volume and high-importance. A lost one silently leaves a component enforcing\na STALE limit. The outbox cost is trivial here and its guarantee is valuable.",
   "originalText": "Why it fits: config changes are low-volume and high-importance. A lost one silently leaves a component enforcing\na STALE limit. The outbox cost is trivial here and its guarantee is valuable.",
