   "text": "Relay (rows wait), Kafka (publish fails, relay retries), consumers (own offset /\nidempotence). Only delay or duplicates.",
   "originalText": "Relay (rows wait), Kafka (publish fails, relay retries), consumers (own offset /\nidempotence). Only delay or duplicates.",
